     {
      "text": "Nisan -- first month i.e. April."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 10,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Tobiah -- Two Tobiahs are distinguished by many:\n\n(1) \"Tobiah the servant, the Ammonite,\" Nehemiah 2:10,19; 4:3,7 6:1,12,14.\n\n(2) A Jew, unable to prove his genealogy. But the reference to the latter (Nehemiah 7:62) indicates that he was already dead. But one Tobiah, and he the Ammonite, is active in this book."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 19,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "laughed -- The obstacle of ridicule."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
